Subject: [PATCH 3/3] R5 round 2: clock at 0 until ready (H1), private pipe
 (H2, H3), asset limit (M4), proxy secret (M5), plain words (L)

H1: no stepping before the page says ready; step(0) flushes only what is due. Frame 0 is shot until stable.
H2/H3: the browser is launched over --remote-debugging-pipe (no port; it ends with the pipe).
M4: a picture/font/style/clip unfinished past assetTimeoutMs (30 s) fails the render in words.
M5: the proxy asks for a per-render secret (407 first, listed host or not).
L: plainWords for EPIPE and closed-browser errors; the browser's own calls leave the blocked count.

